luci-theme-obsidian21 - "Obsidian (21.02 port)" theme for OpenWrt 21.02 LuCI

This package is a port of luci-theme-obsidian ("Obsidian" theme) by vistrocity,
from https://github.com/vistrocity/openwrt-luci-themes
(themes/luci-theme-obsidian, commit a407f7c5ea601ef1fd6d5013fceaf287981d0346),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

The original Obsidian theme is itself a fork of luci-theme-bootstrap from the
OpenWrt LuCI project (https://github.com/openwrt/luci), Apache-2.0:
  Copyright 2008 Steven Barth <steven@midlink.org>
  Copyright 2008-2022 Jo-Philipp Wich <jo@mein.io>
  Copyright 2012 David Menting <david@nut-bolt.nl> (Nut & Bolt)
  Bootstrap v1.4.0, Copyright 2011 Twitter, Inc.

Port changes (2026, Dror Dvash):
  - The stylesheet is rebuilt on the OpenWrt 21.02 luci-theme-bootstrap
    cascade.css/mobile.css (openwrt-21.02 branch, commit afd0012) instead of
    the 25.12 bootstrap, with the unmodified Obsidian override block appended and
    a 21.02 adaptation layer (phone menu, focus states, phone layout).
  - ucode templates (header.ut, footer.ut, sysauth.ut) translated to
    LuCI 21.02 Lua templates (header.htm, footer.htm, sysauth.htm).
  - menu-obsidian.js rewritten as menu-obsidian21.js on the 21.02 menu API with a
    phone hamburger menu; the login view is inlined into sysauth.htm.
  - Theme id renamed obsidian -> obsidian21 so it can coexist with the original.
  - Port generated by tools/port-theme.py (bootstrap baseline).
